\newlabel{fig:model-confusion-matrices}{{5.2}{34}{Pooled row-normalised confusion matrices over the five held-out IEMOCAP sessions ($n=5{,}531$). Rows are true labels and columns are predicted labels; cell values are percentages of the corresponding true-label row. All panels use the same 0--100\% colour scale. Every fitted parameter represented here was estimated without the corresponding test session}{figure.5.2}{}}
